<section class="section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="stack">
        <span class="eyebrow">Questions</span>
        <h2 class="display-md" id="faq-h">What clinics ask before we start.</h2>
        <p class="muted">Straight answers to the questions that come up on most discovery calls.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <details class="faq" open>
          <summary>Does it work with our practice management software?</summary>
          <p>Usually, yes. Many systems have an API or can sync through a calendar. If yours can't connect directly, we'll explain the options on the first call and you decide.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq">
          <summary>Is patient data kept safe?</summary>
          <p>Patient data stays in the systems you already use, and each workflow only gets access to what it needs. We work within your privacy and data protection rules, and go through this in detail before any build.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq">
          <summary>Will the AI give patients medical advice?</summary>
          <p>No. The AI handles booking, admin and common questions about hours, prices and directions. Anything clinical is passed to your team.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq">
          <summary>Do patients need to download an app?</summary>
          <p>No. Messages arrive by SMS, WhatsApp or email, and booking happens on your website or inside the chat.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq">
          <summary>How is a project priced?</summary>
          <p>After the discovery call we send a fixed scope and price for the first workflow. Ongoing support is a separate monthly plan, only if you want it.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
